        "email": "paulsvc02@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-22T12:23:31Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): check for releases at startup and show title-bar update notice\n\nImplement Part B of the update check feature:\n- Add GitHub Releases API check, SemVer comparison, release-notes URL\n  validation, and once-per-day UTC timestamp throttle in camcraft-app.\n- Persist checkForUpdates and lastUpdateCheckUtc in prefs.json without\n  changing document history or dirty state.\n- Spawn the one-shot check on native desktop startup only (disabled on\n  wasm32 and in tests) and wake the event loop once on completion.\n- Add a top-band Settings dropdown with the \"Check for updates\" toggle\n  and a clickable \"Update available: vX.Y.Z\" button that opens the\n  release-notes link in the browser cleanly.\n\nRefs #2428",
